<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1864543209"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:38.602"><div begin="16.169" end="43.437" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.169" end="20.880" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.169" end="17.260">感谢</span><span begin="17.260" end="18.311">忙碌的</span><span begin="18.311" end="18.873">生</span><span begin="18.873" end="20.880">活</span></p><p begin="21.783" end="28.508" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.783" end="22.788">不让</span><span begin="22.788" end="23.265">人</span><span begin="23.265" end="23.609">追</span><span begin="23.609" end="24.364">究</span> <span begin="24.506" end="24.752">太</span><span begin="24.752" end="25.175">难</span><span begin="25.175" end="25.490">为</span><span begin="25.490" end="26.082">的</span><span begin="26.082" end="26.396">永</span><span begin="26.396" end="28.508">恒</span></p><p begin="31.160" end="36.819" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.160" end="34.055">只是空气渐冷</span><span begin="34.055" end="35.299">的</span><span begin="35.299" end="35.796">时</span><span begin="35.796" end="36.819">候</span></p><p begin="37.288" end="43.437" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.288" end="37.837">我会</span><span begin="37.837" end="38.286">想</span><span begin="38.286" end="38.586">到</span><span begin="38.586" end="39.381">你</span> <span begin="39.526" end="39.697">再</span><span begin="39.697" end="40.200">想</span><span begin="40.200" end="40.474">到</span><span begin="40.474" end="41.157">我</span><span begin="41.157" end="41.473">不</span><span begin="41.473" end="43.437">能</span></p></div><div begin="46.224" end="1:13.100" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.224" end="50.998" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.224" end="47.239">我们</span><span begin="47.239" end="47.646">也</span><span begin="47.646" end="47.870">会</span><span begin="47.870" end="48.865">说笑</span><span begin="48.865" end="50.998">着</span></p><p begin="51.804" end="59.258" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.804" end="52.330">努</span><span begin="52.330" end="52.610">力</span><span begin="52.610" end="53.200">的</span><span begin="53.200" end="53.558">天</span><span begin="53.558" end="54.339">真</span> <span begin="54.456" end="54.687">坦</span><span begin="54.687" end="56.056">诚的可</span><span begin="56.056" end="59.258">能</span></p><p begin="1:01.104" end="1:06.885" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.104" end="1:04.009">绝口不提故事</span><span begin="1:04.009" end="1:05.349">的</span><span begin="1:05.349" end="1:05.675">最</span><span begin="1:05.675" end="1:06.885">后</span></p><p begin="1:07.218" end="1:13.100" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.218" end="1:07.795">还是</span><span begin="1:07.795" end="1:08.283">差</span><span begin="1:08.283" end="1:08.579">一</span><span begin="1:08.579" end="1:09.425">点</span> <span begin="1:09.436" end="1:09.712">还</span><span begin="1:09.712" end="1:10.132">是</span><span begin="1:10.132" end="1:10.421">没</span><span begin="1:10.421" end="1:11.112">有</span><span begin="1:11.112" end="1:11.464">实</span><span begin="1:11.464" end="1:13.100">现</span></p></div><div begin="1:15.216" end="1:29.573" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:15.216" end="1:18.751" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.216" end="1:17.181">假如你还</span><span begin="1:17.181" end="1:17.611">爱</span><span begin="1:17.611" end="1:18.061">着</span><span begin="1:18.061" end="1:18.751">我</span></p><p begin="1:19.002" end="1:22.059" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.002" end="1:19.942">爱有</span><span begin="1:19.942" end="1:20.469">多</span><span begin="1:20.469" end="1:20.864">好</span><span begin="1:20.864" end="1:22.059">呢</span></p><p begin="1:22.737" end="1:26.298" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.737" end="1:24.667">你会赶在</span><span begin="1:24.667" end="1:25.122">日</span><span begin="1:25.122" end="1:25.435">暮</span><span begin="1:25.435" end="1:25.818">之</span><span begin="1:25.818" end="